        The Principal, Sunrise Public School<br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:saihimavardhan001@gmail.com">saihimavardhan001@gmail.com</a><br>
        Phone: <a href="tel:+917892552978">+91 78925 52978</a>
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4"><a href="/">Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

